{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"OUDSHeading","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Foundations"]},{"content":[{"text":"Sizes","type":"heading","anchor":"Sizes","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"XLarge"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The largest heading, useful for page titles."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Large (by default)","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": The default heading. Only this size supports the marker and the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"colored substring","type":"text"}]},{"text":" feature.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Medium","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A medium heading, typically used for section titles."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Small","type":"text"}]},{"text":": The smallest heading, used for subsection titles.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Marker","anchor":"Marker","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some themes (like "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Compact"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wireframe"}]},{"type":"text","text":") declare that a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"large","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" heading is decorated with a small"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"coloured rectangle below the text, i.e. the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"marker"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Other themes (like "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Sosh","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") do not use a marker at all but something else."}]},{"text":"Coloring a substring","level":2,"anchor":"Coloring-a-substring","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A dedicated initializer accepts a ","type":"text"},{"code":"coloredText","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" sub-string instead of a marker.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is useful to emphasize a specific word inside a heading (for example a brand name). This feature is only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"meaningful for ","type":"text"},{"code":"size == .large","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; on other sizes a warning is logged and the text is rendered plain.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Warning","style":"warning","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not all themes provide a valid "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"theme.colors.contentBrandSecondary"},{"type":"text","text":" (e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Compact","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the token is marked as forbidden). When the token is forbidden the coloring is skipped."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"text":"Code samples","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Simple raw string","    OUDSHeading(text: \"Title\")","","    \/\/ Large heading with a marker (rendered only when the theme supports it)","    OUDSHeading(text: \"Section title\", size: .large, hasMarker: true)","","    \/\/ Smaller heading (marker parameter would be ignored here)","    OUDSHeading(text: \"Sub-section\", size: .medium)","","    \/\/ Heading with a brand-coloured word","    OUDSHeading(text: \"Welcome to Orange\", coloredText: \"Orange\")","","    \/\/ Combined: coloured word","    OUDSHeading(text: \"Welcome to Sosh\", coloredText: \"Sosh\")","","    \/\/ Localizable from a bundle","    OUDSHeading(LocalizedStringKey(\"section_title\"), bundle: Bundle.module, size: .large)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Accessibility","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component adds the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".isHeader"},{"type":"text","text":" accessibility trait so that assistive technologies (like "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"VoiceOver","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"announce the text as a header. When a marker is drawn, it is hidden from assistive technologies (decorative)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Design documentation","type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-typography-heading","type":"reference"}]},{"text":"Themes rendering","type":"heading","anchor":"Themes-rendering","level":2},{"type":"heading","text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_typography_heading_Orange"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_typography_heading_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Sosh","anchor":"Sosh","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_typography_heading_Sosh"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Wireframe","anchor":"